#: app/templates/index.html:7
msgid ""
"Practice for a thousand days to refine the steel; practice for ten "
"thousand days to polish the spirit."
msgstr ""
"Übe tausend Tage, um den Stahl zu härten; übe zehntausend Tage, "
"um den Geist zu schleifen."

